 "text": "Hi, how have you been? Quite bit, actually. It expands your vocabulary, even if you don't know all the context. That's normal at first. Try shows with simple plots, and pick ones with subtitles you like the style of. A few is good. More than that can feel overwhelming. Aim for something you'd genuinely enjoy, even if it' not famous. The joy of the story is what matters most. Enjoy it with subtitles on your native language. You' be surprised how much you absorb.",
